### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = change-me-to-a-long-random-string
@routerId = main

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Print System Resource (CPU, Uptime, Memory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/system/resource/print"
}

### 3. Print Interfaces dengan Proplist (Hanya nama, tipe, status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/interface/print",
  "args": {
    ".proplist": ".id,name,type,running,disabled"
  }
}

### 4. Print IP Addresses (Filter hanya yang aktif / ?disabled=no)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/ip/address/print",
  "args": {
    "?disabled": "no"
  }
}

### 5. Tambah Hotspot User Baru (Create Voucher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/ip/hotspot/user/add",
  "args": {
    "name": "voucher_test_01",
    "password": "pass123456",
    "profile": "default",
    "comment": "Dibuat via Rust Gateway"
  }
}

### 6. Ambil Daftar Hotspot User
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/ip/hotspot/user/print",
  "args": {
    ".proplist": ".id,name,profile,uptime,bytes-in,bytes-out"
  }
}

### 7. Hapus Hotspot User berdasarkan .id
POST {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "/ip/hotspot/user/remove",
  "args": {
    ".id": "*1"
  }
}

### 8. SSE Streaming Traffic Interface (Buka di browser atau SSE client)
GET {{baseUrl}}/routers/{{routerId}}/listen?command=/interface/monitor-traffic&interface=ether1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
